{"name":"Buttercup","hex":"#da9429","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"buttercup","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Any of many herbs, of the genus Ranunculus, having yellow flowers; the crowfoot.","Any flower of the genus Narcissus; a daffodil."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/buttercup"}],"entries":[{"title":"Buttercup (TV series)","blocks":[{"text":"Buttercup is a Philippine television drama series broadcast by ABS-CBN. Directed by Wenn V. Deramas, it stars Claudine Barretto, Assunta de Rossi, Onemig Bondoc, Ciara Sotto, Mico Palanca, Piolo Pascual, and Diether Ocampo. It premiered on May 31, 2003 on the network's Saturday evening line up. The show concluded on February 7, 2004, with a total of 37 episodes."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/6/66/Buttercup_2003.png/330px-Buttercup_2003.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Buttercup_(TV_series)","wikidata":"Q5002865"},{"title":"Ranunculus","blocks":[{"text":"Ranunculus is a large genus of about 1750 species of flowering plants in the family Ranunculaceae. Members of the genus are known as buttercups, spearworts and water crowfoots."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d9/Ranunculus_eschscholtzii.jpg/330px-Ranunculus_eschscholtzii.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ranunculus","wikidata":"Q146130"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/c/cd/Buttercup.jpeg/330px-Buttercup.jpeg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/c/cd/Buttercup.jpeg/330px-Buttercup.jpeg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The Cast of Buttercup","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AButtercup.jpeg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.o